WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.121
We compare the short version with its source.

00:00:03.121 --> 00:00:07.411
It has omitted the condition that complete information must arrive first.

00:00:07.411 --> 00:00:14.042
We restore that condition, check who can approve the message, and retain the original and revised drafts.

00:00:14.042 --> 00:00:23.014
The Project Record also includes the adapted version, one useful wording change, and a claim still needing review in Lesson Two Point Three.
